('2b3c4d5e-6f7a-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d7e', 'Electric Cars: The Future of Nepal', 'electric-cars-future-nepal', '<p>Why EVs are becoming popular in Nepal and what to expect in the coming years...</p>', 'Why EVs are becoming popular in Nepal and what to expect in the coming years', 'Electric Vehicles', 'https://placehold.co/800x400?text=Electric+Cars', 'CarKinne Team', '2024-10-10', true, 'Electric Cars: The Future of Nepal', 'Why EVs are becoming popular in Nepal and what to expect in the coming years');